674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=L6OT72TsPlYQ7kNvwGZ3zzS&_nc_oc=AdquePinrQp1y99DYDoezVhuK8sKrtuxZnL2poOf00xgTzR0_y32Sx1lt7FC5_jve3U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af2s-RDtaH-WJpHc_Wwuu_etaunTPIjRoLTkNt0tZ6L6pA&oe=69F60AD9"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gFu6fVhZvQQQ7kNvwG2z2Us&_nc_oc=AdqNov8XwOJOxzyh4C5WCRGYgHg83dyzdOWqUCOcFhZOxIkPED15fU1700z31YlHL2A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af1EZTatEyJ-YcH2UVpTTrZCpEN_LjsurLxq2Qu6hcf3OQ&oe=69F61396"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZAM7PvqZh_MQ7kNvwG2tpiS&_nc_oc=AdpooAZrttPan_EhgLc4Pnc_WDCx8VizE5xHyiXFR72wcjCsWO131HnjL1j_71DHldA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af2_C4vTuAXCO_unLwhBvS4X0xaJ6J-W7CYXWVOmGFnzWg&oe=69F60FB1"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip